  "description": "DNABERT-2 is a DNA language model used for genomics sequence representation tasks such as promoter/enhancer and variant-oriented embeddings. This hidden onboarding manifest uses the Forge life-science transformer wrapper with a DNA embedding mode added for the ClawBio event. The upstream Hugging Face metadata marks this repository as public, transformers-based, and custom-code backed; BIO_TRUST_REMOTE_CODE is therefore explicit and must remain reviewed before publication. BIO_ATTENTION_DROPOUT_OVERRIDE is set to route DNABERT-2's remote attention code through its PyTorch fallback instead of a Triton kernel path incompatible with the current PyTorch/Triton runtime, BIO_TORCH_DTYPE=float32 avoids a BF16/FP32 mismatch in that fallback branch, and the wrapper accepts DNABERT-2's tuple-shaped model output. H200/eu-north2 has a 10-run benchmark; the full GPU/region matrix is still pending, so the model must stay hidden and non-default.",
